Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 13:09:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Fix missing <cstring> include in WDC3TableReader.cpp

Relies on the memcpy/memset family without including <cstring>,
which isn't guaranteed to be pulled in transitively by anything else
this file includes.
---
 src/readers/wdc3/WDC3TableReader.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/readers/wdc3/WDC3TableReader.cpp b/src/readers/wdc3/WDC3TableReader.cpp
index a7592ae..38fb701 100644
--- a/src/readers/wdc3/WDC3TableReader.cpp
+++ b/src/readers/wdc3/WDC3TableReader.cpp
@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@
 #include <readers/wdc3/WDC3TableReader.h>
 
+#include <cstring>
+
 namespace BlizzardDatabaseLib {
     namespace Reader {
   
